FREELANCE BUSINESS MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Product Requirements and Development Specification

Document purpose: Complete functional, technical, architectural and UI/UX requirements for building the application.

---

1. PRODUCT OVERVIEW

1.1 Product Vision

Build a comprehensive business management system for an independent software developer and technology service provider.

The system should manage the complete business lifecycle, from the first contact with a potential client to project delivery, payment collection, maintenance and ongoing support.

It should reduce administrative work, automate repetitive processes, organise client relationships, manage projects and provide a clear picture of the financial position of the business.

The system should initially support one business owner but should be designed so that multiple businesses or users can be supported in the future.

1.2 Business Scope

Although the initial business focuses on software development, the system must not be hardcoded around software development alone.

It should support different services, including:

- Custom software development.
- Mobile application development.
- Desktop application development.
- Website development.
- Business management systems.
- Database management.
- IT consultancy.
- Technical support.
- Software maintenance.
- Other professional services.

Services should be configurable by the business owner.

1.3 Supported Platforms

The product will consist of three connected applications.

Platform| Purpose
Android application| Mobile business management and quick operations
Desktop application| Full business management and administration
Client web portal| Client onboarding, project tracking, approvals and payments

Clients should not be required to install an application. They should access their information through secure web links.

