14. CLIENT PORTAL

The client portal is a separate, responsive web application.

Clients should access it through a secure link without installing the Android or desktop application.

14.1 Client Access

Generate a unique portal access link for each client or project.

Security requirements:

- Use cryptographically secure random tokens.
- Never use predictable record IDs as access credentials.
- Allow token expiry.
- Allow token revocation.
- Support reissuing access links.
- Limit access to the relevant client and project.
- Avoid exposing internal business information.

Additional authentication, such as an email OTP, can be introduced where appropriate.

