It should help the business owner perform tasks faster.

19.1 Supported Capabilities

- Natural-language search.
- Requirements extraction.
- Conversation summaries.
- Document extraction.
- Draft quotation preparation.
- Project summaries.
- Client history summaries.
- Business questions.
- Voice-based transaction or record entry.
- Suggested follow-up actions.

Examples:

"Show me all unpaid invoices."

"How much have I collected this month?"

"Summarise the requirements for the payroll project."

"Prepare a draft quotation from this client's requirements."

