FINAL PRODUCT DIRECTION

This is not simply an invoicing application, a project tracker or a CRM.

It is a connected business operating system for a professional service provider.

Its main purpose is to connect clients, communication, quotations, agreements, projects, payments, documents and automation into one organised environment.

The desktop application should provide the full management experience.

The Android application should provide a clean, fast and practical mobile experience.

The client portal should provide clients with visibility and access to their own information.

Automation should handle repetitive work.

AI should assist where it adds genuine value.

The design should remain minimalist, professional and human-designed. Every screen, button, label and feature must have a purpose.